      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sadly this would only cause people to keep their account logged in overnight when sleeping to gain levels. Increasing server load for no real benefit as levels have no significance otherwise. Currently the closest to leveling we have is once you reach a certain milestone of timeplayed/friends added/etc you are able to upload worlds and avatars. That's about it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
