      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think just having a \"Join date\" for a profile would suffice.  So you can tell who is new, and who's been around for awhile, who might have some technical knowledge.  Maybe later have some options to only view people who have been around at least a month (or varied option) and your avatar can't be seen by new players, if you set it that way.  So you are less likely to see trolls, and less likely to have avatars stolen (in theory, if they get banned for doing so, and try making new accounts)",
      "viewerReactions": null
